Asking
------

If you want to do something this file does not allow, ask rather than assume the
answer is no: hello@enforcee.app.

If you are a researcher benchmarking verification tools, a student, a security
reviewer, or you work on a non-commercial project and cannot pay, say so. The
answer is very likely yes, and it will not cost you anything.
